athering together informally without  some sort of government consent it's a  reminder that freedom of assembly is  part of the First Amendment as well as  religion and speech your book is  available at Amazon where is the best  place to seek out your writings Jigme  are equai ing em Arg I want to thank you  mod the author of the new memoir Chinese  girl in the ghetto for talking to reason  TV thank you very much thank you for  having me and for reason TV I'm Nicolas  you

